lty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,18,74,62,82,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,18,74,62,82,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,18,74,62,82,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[25,18,74,62,82,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"汉末文臣，卫觊之弟，出身于名门望族河东卫氏。 自幼聪慧，饱读诗书，在士族圈中颇有名气。 约在蔡文姬十六岁时，娶其为妻，两人婚后琴瑟和鸣，生活幸福。然而，这段婚姻仅持续约一年，卫仲道便身患重疾咳血而早逝。由于婚姻短暂，二人未有子嗣。蔡文姬因此不被婆家待见，被归咎克夫，最终返回娘家。","tc":"漢末文臣，衛覬之弟，出身于名門望族河東衛氏。 自幼聰慧，飽讀詩書，在士族圈中頗有名氣。 約在蔡文姬十六歲時，娶其為妻，兩人婚后琴瑟和鳴，生活幸福。然而，這段婚姻僅持續約一年，衛仲道便身患重疾咳血而早逝。由于婚姻短暫，二人未有子嗣。蔡文姬因此不被婆家待見，被歸咎克夫，最終返回娘家。","en":"A civil official of the late Han and younger brother of Wei Ji, born to the prominent Wei clan of Hedong. Intelligent from childhood and thoroughly versed in poetry and the classics, he enjoyed considerable renown among the gentry. When Cai Wenji was around sixteen years of age, he took her as his wife, and the two lived in harmonious and happy wedlock. However, this marriage lasted only about a year before Wei Zhongdao fell gravely ill, coughing blood, and died young. Owing to the brevity of their marriage, they bore no children. As a result, Cai Wenji found no favor with her in-laws, who blamed her for bringing misfortune upon her husband, and she ultimately returned to her maiden home.","jp":"後漢末期の文臣。衛覬の弟で、名門望族である河東衛氏の出身。幼少より聡明で、詩書に通じ、士族の間で大いに名を知られていた。蔡文姫がおよそ十六歳の頃に妻として娶り、夫婦仲は睦まじく、幸せな日々を送った。しかし、その婚姻関係はわずか一年ほどしか続かず、衛仲道は重病を患って喀血し早世した。婚姻が短期間であったため、二人の間に子は生まれなかった。蔡文姫はそれゆえ婚家から疎まれ、夫を早死にさせたと咎められて、最後は実家へと戻ることとなった。","kr":"한말의 문신이자 위기의 아우로, 명문망족인 하동 위씨 출신입니다. 어려서부터 총명하고 시서를 탐독하여 사족들 사이에서 명망이 높았습니다. 채문희가 16세 되던 해에 아내로 맞이하였으며, 부부간의 금슬이 매우 좋아 화목하게 살았습니다. 그러나 이 혼인은 불과 1년여 만에 위중도가 중병에 걸려 피를 토하고 요절하면서 끝나고 말았습니다. 혼인 기간이 짧아 슬하에 자식이 없었기에, 채문희는 시댁의 냉대를 받고 남편을 잡아먹었다는 원망을 사다 결국 친정으로 돌아갔습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038115","remark":"","surname":"卫","surnameTc":"衛","surnameEn":"Wei","surnameJp":"衛","surnameKr":"위","surnameOther":"","name":"宁","nameTc":"寧","nameEn":"Ning","nameJp":"寧","nameKr":"영","nameOther":"","word":"仲道","wordTc":"仲道","wordEn":"Zhongdao","wordJp":"仲道","wordKr":"중도","wordOther":"","icon":"卫宁","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1051","gender":"0","rule":"25","force":"18","wise":"74","politics":"62","charm":"82","will":"55","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"17/17/17/17/17/53/27/17","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill